{%- doc -%}
  Quick-add styles consolidated into a single snippet.

  UNWIRED from M&P card surfaces (Phase 13 round 3 — Dawn-native quick-add
  ruling, Nathan 2026-07-07): no card-chain file renders this anymore —
  Horizon and Dawn BOTH use the .quick-add class, so this CSS must stay off
  any page running Dawn's quick-add.css (the gated hosts load it). Stays
  in-repo as ported vocabulary (port-everything frame); re-wire = restore
  the card-chain renders together with the Horizon-modal swap.

  ROUND-3 SERVE FIX — {% stylesheet %} → {% style %}: Shopify aggregates
  EVERY {% stylesheet %} block in the theme into the page-global styles.css
  regardless of whether the file renders (probed: the unwired `.quick-add
  { inset: 0; pointer-events: none }` rule still painted Dawn's trigger
  top-left/unclickable). {% style %} emits only at actual render sites —
  zero CSS while unwired, byte-identical rules + specificity if re-wired
  (renders inline per render; browser tolerates duplicates).

  Port of stock Horizon v4.1.1 (68760d9) snippets/quick-add-styles.liquid
  (horizon-blocks Phase 13). Deviations:
  - DAWN-VISUAL RULING (Nathan, serve gate 2026-07-06): the card trigger
    matches LIVE M&P (snippets/card-product.liquid quick-add +
    assets/quick-add.css:1-7,357-364) — a Dawn .button square with Dawn's
    own plus icon, ALWAYS visible when the host setting is on — instead of
    stock Horizon's hover-reveal expanding pill. Concretely:
    - Dawn's .button supplies background / color / border-radius / ::after
      border+shadow (base.css loads after the stylesheet aggregate — the
      Phase-1b cascade inversion — so every tie we don't contest goes to
      Dawn, which here is the point). The doubled selector wins only the
      geometry we do contest (padding/offsets/display).
    - padding: 1rem + 1rem icon + right/bottom 1rem offsets mirror live
      quick-add.css values; rem here resolves against DAWN's root exactly
      like live.
    - The stock pill machinery is REMOVED, not overridden: hover-reveal
      (opacity 0→1), text-expand grid transitions, pill gradient/backdrop
      blur, --button-size-md height. The Add/Choose label is visually-hidden
      (icon-only trigger, label kept for AT). Restore from stock
      quick-add-styles:35-133,161-246 if the Horizon pill is ever wanted.
    - The markup side of the ruling: quick-add.liquid + add-to-cart-button's
      icon param swap the cart glyph for Dawn's icon-plus.svg.
  - settings.quick_add_background / quick_add_text stand-ins kept (scheme-1
    lookup below) — now consumed only by the modal-side rules; harmless.
  - --quick-add-display / -mobile-display / -mobile-opacity were per-card
    state emitted by snippets/product-card.liquid; round 3 re-trimmed those
    emissions (Dawn-native quick-add) — the consumers below fall back to
    none/0 (hidden), correct for the unwired state; re-wire restores the
    emissions with the render swap.
  - Per-consumer .quick-add-modal__close shim (popup-link close precedent,
    Phase-9 split-shim rule): border/padding the UA supplies once the
    `button` class is dropped, plus doubled-selector position (the
    dialog-styles .close-button base is position:fixed; aggregate order
    between the two files is nondeterministic, the doubling makes the
    modal's absolute placement win).

  @example
  {% render 'quick-add-styles' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- comment -%} ADAPT (see doc header): scheme-1 stand-ins at the Horizon
  schema defaults for the missing quick_add_background/_text settings. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign hz_quick_add_scheme = settings.color_schemes | first -%}
{% style %}
  .custom-color-quick-add {
    --quick-add-background: rgb({{ hz_quick_add_scheme.settings.background.rgb }});
    --quick-add-foreground: rgb({{ hz_quick_add_scheme.settings.text.rgb }});
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% comment %} Round-3 serve fix: {% style %} not {% stylesheet %} — see header. {% endcomment %}
{% style %}
  /* Quick Add */
  .quick-add {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: var(--layer-raised);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .quick-add .variant-option__button-label input[data-option-available='false'] {
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  /* DAWN-VISUAL trigger (see doc header): Dawn .button square + plus icon,
     always visible. Doubled selector wins the contested geometry; Dawn's
     .button (later stylesheet) keeps background/color/radius/::after. */
  .quick-add__button.quick-add__button {
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 0;
    display: var(--quick-add-mobile-display, none);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem; /* live .quick-add__submit */
    height: auto;
    cursor: pointer;
    opacity: var(--quick-add-mobile-opacity, 0);
    pointer-events: all;
    position: absolute;
    right: 1rem; /* live .quick-add margin */
    bottom: 1rem;

    .quick-add[stay-visible] & {
      display: flex;
    }

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      display: var(--quick-add-display, flex);
      opacity: 1; /* always visible — live M&P parity (stock reveals on hover) */
    }
  }

  .quick-add__button .add-to-cart-text {
    background: transparent;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .quick-add__button .svg-wrapper .checkmark-burst {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .quick-add__button .add-to-cart-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
  }

  .quick-add__button .add-to-cart-icon svg {
    width: 1rem; /* live .quick-add__submit svg */
    height: auto;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Dawn visual: icon-only trigger — the Add/Choose label stays for AT. */
  .quick-add__button .add-to-cart-text__content {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .quick-add__button[data-added='true'] .add-to-cart-text {
    animation-name: atc-fade-out;
  }

  .quick-add__button[data-added='true'] .add-to-cart-text--added {
    translate: 0 0;
    animation-name: atc-fade-in;
  }

  .quick-add__product-form-component {
    height: 100%;
  }

  .quick-add__product-form-component .shopify-product-form {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: flex-end;
    container-type: inline-size;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .quick-add-modal .product-media {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .quick-add-modal deferred-media {
    display: none;
  }

  .quick-add-modal .media-gallery--carousel slideshow-component {
    --cursor: default;
  }

  /* Per-consumer close shim (see doc header): UA border/padding once the
     `button` class is dropped + deterministic absolute placement over the
     dialog-styles .close-button position:fixed base. */
  .quick-add-modal__close.quick-add-modal__close {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--margin-2xs);
    right: var(--margin-2xs);
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
  }
{% endstyle %}
